# 20. PARTY FAILURE

Jika satu Party gagal, Dungeon tidak otomatis selalu gagal.

Dungeon System membaca aturan Mission.

Kemungkinan:

```text
Party Failed
     ↓
Objective Failed
     ↓
Event Trigger
     ↓
Difficulty Change
     ↓
Other Party Affected
```

atau:

```text
Party Failed
     ↓
Dungeon Failed
```

tergantung aturan Floor.

Pada Floor biasa:

```text
1 Party Failed
     ↓
Dungeon dapat langsung gagal
```

Pada Multi-Party Floor:

```text
1 Party Failed
     ↓
Party lain masih dapat melanjutkan
```

Namun, jika Party tersebut memegang objective utama:

```text
Main Objective Failed
     ↓
Dungeon Failed
```

