# 32. PARTY SLOT AND RNG

Party Slot Requirement tidak menggunakan RNG.

Jumlah Party ditentukan secara tetap berdasarkan Floor.

```text
MILESTONE FLOOR
=
FIXED PARTY REQUIREMENT

NON-MILESTONE FLOOR
=
1 PARTY
```

RNG digunakan pada:

```text
Enemy Quantity
Enemy Selection
Loot
Floor Reward
Exploration Reward
Raid Reward
Quest Reward
Event Random Result
```

